group cls.entities | mechanism: token class flags FILE KEY NAME WORDV NUM SECRETS PATH | why: heads and rules select by class; numbers are ids 12..1011 so one range sets NUM
embed @config,@notes,@budget,@train,@eval,@deploy,@team,@todo,@readme,@schedule,@data,@model,@server,@backup,@report,@users,@network,@plan,@release,@costs,@logs,@inventory,@roadmap,@metrics 16 = 1
